portable WASM seed, built from source at the commit immediately preceding the
commit that ships this file. The seed is a wasm64 compiler using interpreter
metaprogramming and contains both native object backends. Bootstrap selection
translates it with src/bootstrap/wasm2c.c only when no usable matching native
seed exists.

source: src/compiler/main_wasm.coil
